# Track ONLY authored workflow content under .claude/ (rules + skills).
# Everything else in .claude/ (credentials, runtime state, history, plugins,
# project memory, tasks, sessions, caches) stays local-only.
# Re-include the dir first (it is excluded by the .* rule above), then
# re-exclude all its contents except the authored subfolders.
!.claude/
.claude/*
!.claude/rules/
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/evals/
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/agents/
# shared ecosystem config (hooks + plugins) is tracked; personal prefs +
# machine permissions stay in the gitignored settings.local.json
!.claude/settings.json

build_pure/
**/build_pure/
